# ---------------------------------------------------------------- 50. the leading player leaves the company (pairs D3b)
# In a repertory or touring company the company actor steps up at 9 to 10 (real 20 to 30), one way in every color.
# The pairs are the other roads: leaving too, letting the director choose, bringing in a friend, a promise of the next
# lead, and a company that closes ranks against an outsider.

