# ---------------------------------------------------------------- 51. opening night at the fringe (pairs D4a)
# It is the person's own show, so every act brings [a lead role to remember]: the five ways of playing the night at 84
# to 90, and the five long shots that can follow it (the transfer 10, an agent 12, a paid run back home 15: each the
# first paid part, never the lead itself; a following 15, good notices 30) bring it even when they fail. The long
# shots sit on the pairs so every color has one; Red, the fringe's own color, has two. The night comes to someone in
# work or on the rung below a paid part (LIFE_STAGE).

== opening night at the fringe
tier: life event
stages: young_adult adult mature elder
age: 16-95
holds: a fringe slot
per_year: 0 0 .8 .8 .8 .8
