# ---------------------------------------------------------------- 61. the theatre needs an artistic director (triads D3a)
# The theatre that chooses its leads: [artistic director] at 8 to 11 in every color. Round 5, 2026-10-07 (P3): no
# life met it at three years (director stints in the engine last about 1 to 4.5 years), so it comes after two years
# as a director (a summit's step, engine 10:38) and a little more often (per_year .04 to .1: a working director sees
# several theatres' top posts open in a decade, and can apply to any of them). The triads are backing a younger
# director, the deputy's post, staying freelance, backing the board's choice for a promise of work, and a small company
# started with friends.

